  "ruleText": "Phy 501.03 Ethical Standards for Physical Therapist Assistants. The ethical standards for physical therapist assistants shall be the Standards of Ethical Conduct for the Physical Therapist Assistant.\n\nSource. #9295, eff 10-16-08; ss by #9870, eff 2-18-11, EXPIRED: 2-18-19\n\nNew. #12945, eff 12-20-19\n\nAPPENDIX I\n\nAPPENDIX II\n\nRULE | Title | Obtain at:\n\nPhy 501.01(b) | Code of Ethics for the Physical Therapist (as amended June 2019) | http://www.apta.org/Ethics/Core/\n\nPhy 501.01(c) | Standards of Ethical Conduct for the Physical Therapist Assistant (as amended August 12, 2020) | http://www.apta.org/Ethics/Core/",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/phy500.html"
